+	if tagSize != gcmTagSize {
+		return cipher.NewGCMWithTagSize(&noGCM{c}, tagSize) // CodeQL [SM04391] This is to keep compatibility with upstream, it's on end user teams to raise exceptions with the Crypto Board.
